  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Anticipatory humanitarian assistance to support affected populations in preparing for and responding to flooding in the municipality of Kourtheye,Tillab&#xe9;ri region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to protect vulnerable populations in the municipality of Kourtheye, in the Tillab&#xe9;ri region, Niger from the impacts of river flooding by implementing anticipatory actions aimed at mitigating humanitarian consequences, reducing potential losses and strengthening communities&apos; capacity to cope with shocks.</narrative>
  </description>
